## 获取我的进行中迭代

获取我的进行中迭代

| method | GET |
|-|-|
| url | /v1.0/work/my/undergoingiteration |
| buc login | true |

### Query parameters

| 参数名称 | 参数类型 | 必传 | 默认值 | 参数描述 |
|-|-|-|-|-|
| pn | Number | false | 0 | 页码，用于分页查询 |
| rn | Number | false | 20 | 返回的数据条数 |
| order | String | false | desc | 排序方式，升序/降序 |
| orderTarget | String | false | id | 按 orderTarget 排序 |
| version | String | false | - | 筛选指定版本号 |
| name | String | false | - | 模糊搜索迭代名称 |
| description | String | false | - | 模糊搜索迭代描述 |

### Returns

| 参数名称 | 参数描述 |
|-|-|
| iterations | 迭代详情，对象结构如下：({...[Iteration](https://alidocs.dingtalk.com/i/nodes/20eMKjyp810mMdK4Ho0P33q2JxAZB1Gv?utm_scene=team_space&iframeQuery=anchorId%3Duu_ls6xiuwp43jozm69u9h), app: [App](https://alidocs.dingtalk.com/i/nodes/20eMKjyp810mMdK4Ho0P33q2JxAZB1Gv?utm_scene=team_space&iframeQuery=anchorId%3Duu_ls4gore2dimt38o1v5g), user: [User](https://alidocs.dingtalk.com/i/nodes/20eMKjyp810mMdK4Ho0P33q2JxAZB1Gv?utm_scene=team_space&iframeQuery=anchorId%3Duu_ls369lxfelxab4mn50j), lastTask: [Task](https://alidocs.dingtalk.com/i/nodes/20eMKjyp810mMdK4Ho0P33q2JxAZB1Gv?utm_scene=team_space&iframeQuery=anchorId%3Duu_ls8dfb66h0t67j0phai), iterationconf: [IterationConf](https://alidocs.dingtalk.com/i/nodes/20eMKjyp810mMdK4Ho0P33q2JxAZB1Gv?utm_scene=team_space&iframeQuery=anchorId%3Duu_ls8c3kve3swm6gi6twn), devbranches: [Change](https://alidocs.dingtalk.com/i/nodes/20eMKjyp810mMdK4Ho0P33q2JxAZB1Gv?utm_scene=team_space&iframeQuery=anchorId%3Duu_ls8c5351a5qllc8tzaq)[]})[] |
| total | 总迭代数 |
| pn | 当前页面 |
| rn | 每页迭代数 |

